    fr: 'Channel 4 News diffuse l’enquête de Verbatim : trois sondages JL Partners commandés par Reform et payés par une société américaine, publiés comme indépendants. Farage, filmé à Clacton fin juillet, y qualifie le sondage d’« amazing » et de « bang for buck », puis conclut : « It worked. Boom. »',
    en: 'Channel 4 News broadcasts Verbatim’s investigation: three JL Partners polls commissioned by Reform and paid for by a US company, published as independent. Farage, filmed in Clacton in late July, calls the polling “amazing” and “bang for buck”, then: “It worked. Boom.”',
    es: 'Channel 4 News emite la investigación de Verbatim: tres encuestas de JL Partners encargadas por Reform y pagadas por una empresa estadounidense, publicadas como independientes. Farage, filmado en Clacton a finales de julio, las llama «amazing» y «bang for buck», y concluye: «It worked. Boom.»',
  },
  {
    source: 'The Guardian', kind: 'report', when: '2026-09-03',
    url: 'https://www.theguardian.com/politics/2026/sep/03/reform-officials-plotted-to-break-law-on-foreign-donations-in-undercover-film',
    fr: 'Le Guardian rapporte que le chef des politiques de Reform, James Orr, dit dans les images que Farage « doesn’t know, won’t know » et qu’il préférerait « rather not know », tout en jugeant le montage « totally legit ». Dan Jukes y présente l’opérateur infiltré comme un « key donor for off-the-book project » et décrit le sondage comme « clandestine ». Le journal souligne que l’enquête tombe la veille du congrès de Reform, où Farage doit parler vendredi.',
    en: 'The Guardian reports that Reform’s head of policy James Orr says on camera that Farage “doesn’t know, won’t know” and would “rather not know”, while calling the arrangement “totally legit”. Dan Jukes introduces the undercover operative as a “key donor for off-the-book project” and describes the polling as “clandestine”. The paper notes the story lands on the eve of Reform’s conference, where Farage speaks on Friday.',
    es: 'The Guardian informa de que el jefe de políticas de Reform, James Orr, dice en las imágenes que Farage «doesn’t know, won’t know» y que preferiría «rather not know», al tiempo que califica el montaje de «totally legit». Dan Jukes presenta al operativo encubierto como «key donor for off-the-book project». El diario subraya que la historia llega en vísperas del congreso de Reform.',
  },
  {
    source: 'Reform UK', kind: 'response', when: '2026-09-03',
    url: 'https://www.theguardian.com/politics/2026/sep/03/reform-officials-plotted-to-break-law-on-foreign-donations-in-undercover-film',
    fr: 'Reform UK nie tout acte répréhensible et se dit cible d’un « hoax » monté par des militants climatiques financés de l’étranger se faisant passer pour des donateurs. Le parti affirme disposer d’un processus de vérification des donateurs approuvé par l’Electoral Commission et identifie Verbatim comme une société créée en juillet 2026 par le Centre for Climate Reporting.',
    en: 'Reform UK denies any wrongdoing and says it was the target of a hoax by foreign-funded climate activists posing as would-be donors. The party says it has a donor vetting process approved by the Electoral Commission, and identifies Verbatim as a company incorporated in July 2026 by the Centre for Climate Reporting.',
    es: 'Reform UK niega cualquier irregularidad y afirma haber sido objeto de un engaño de activistas climáticos financiados desde el extranjero que se hacían pasar por donantes. El partido dice tener un proceso de verificación aprobado por la Electoral Commission e identifica a Verbatim como una empresa creada en julio de 2026 por el Centre for Climate Reporting.',
  },
  {
    source: 'Bridget Phillipson, présidente du Parti travailliste', kind: 'reaction', when: '2026-09-03',
    url: 'https://www.theguardian.com/politics/2026/sep/03/reform-officials-plotted-to-break-law-on-foreign-donations-in-undercover-film',
    fr: 'La présidente du Labour déclare que le scandale « goes right to the top of Reform UK » et demande à Farage de prouver que son équipe dirigeante n’a pas enfreint la loi.',
    en: 'Labour’s party chair says the scandal “goes right to the top of Reform UK” and calls on Farage to prove his top team has not broken the law.',
    es: 'La presidenta del laborismo afirma que el escándalo «goes right to the top of Reform UK» y pide a Farage que demuestre que su cúpula no infringió la ley.',
  },
  {
    source: 'Ed Davey, chef des libéraux-démocrates', kind: 'reaction', when: '2026-09-03',
    url: 'https://www.channel4.com/news/nigel-farage-should-face-full-force-of-law-if-found-guilty-of-election-rules-breach-sir-ed-davey',
    fr: 'Ed Davey demande à la police et à l’Electoral Commission d’enquêter, et déclare à Channel 4 que Farage devrait affronter « toute la force » de la loi s’il était reconnu coupable d’une infraction aux règles électorales.',
    en: 'Ed Davey calls on the police and the Electoral Commission to investigate, telling Channel 4 that Farage should face “the full force” of the law if found guilty of breaching election rules.',
    es: 'Ed Davey pide a la policía y a la Electoral Commission que investiguen, y dice a Channel 4 que Farage debería afrontar «toda la fuerza» de la ley si fuera declarado culpable.',
  },
  {
    source: 'ITV News', kind: 'report', when: '2026-09-03',
    url: 'https://www.itv.com/news/2026-09-03/reform-reported-to-police-over-alleged-foreign-donations',
    fr: 'ITV News rapporte que Reform a été signalé à la police à la suite de l’enquête.',
    en: 'ITV News reports that Reform has been reported to the police following the investigation.',
    es: 'ITV News informa de que Reform ha sido denunciado a la policía tras la investigación.',
  },
  {
    source: 'Bob Posner, ancien directeur général de l’Electoral Commission', kind: 'reaction', when: '2026-09-03',
    url: 'https://channel4news.substack.com/p/exclusive-nigel-farage-filmed-undercover',
    fr: 'Interrogé par Channel 4, l’ancien directeur général de l’Electoral Commission estime que des « infractions pénales graves » pourraient avoir été commises et qu’une enquête criminelle s’impose. La Commission indique de son côté que toute tentative d’échapper aux règles sur les dons relève de la police.',
    en: 'Asked by Channel 4, the Electoral Commission’s former chief executive says “serious criminal offences” may have been committed and that a criminal investigation is warranted. The Commission itself says any attempt to evade the donation rules is a matter for the police.',
    es: 'Consultado por Channel 4, el ex director general de la Electoral Commission considera que pudieron cometerse «infracciones penales graves». La propia Comisión señala que cualquier intento de eludir las reglas sobre donaciones corresponde a la policía.',
  },
  {
    source: 'Ofcom', kind: 'report', when: '2026-09-03',
    url: 'https://www.aol.com/ofcom-not-investigate-channel-4-202132706.html',
    fr: 'Ofcom fait savoir qu’il n’ouvrira pas d’enquête sur Channel 4 au sujet du reportage sous couverture.',
    en: 'Ofcom says it will not investigate Channel 4 over the undercover report.',
    es: 'Ofcom comunica que no investigará a Channel 4 por el reportaje encubierto.',
  },
  {
    source: 'The Telegraph · The Times', kind: 'response', when: '2026-09-03',
    url: 'https://www.theguardian.com/politics/2026/sep/03/reform-officials-plotted-to-break-law-on-foreign-donations-in-undercover-film',
    fr: 'Le Telegraph indique avoir suspendu ses articles fondés sur ces sondages ; le Times dit ne pas avoir eu connaissance du lien avec Reform.',
    en: 'The Telegraph says it has suspended the articles based on the polling; the Times says it was not aware of the relationship with Reform.',
    es: 'The Telegraph dice haber suspendido los artículos basados en esas encuestas; el Times afirma que desconocía la relación con Reform.',
  },
];

const PUBLISHED_LABELS: Record<string, Record<Locale, string>> = {
  farage: { fr: 'Nigel Farage (Reform UK)', en: 'Nigel Farage (Reform UK)', es: 'Nigel Farage (Reform UK)' },
  binface: { fr: 'Count Binface', en: 'Count Binface', es: 'Count Binface' },
  fox: { fr: 'Laurence Fox (Reclaim)', en: 'Laurence Fox (Reclaim)', es: 'Laurence Fox (Reclaim)' },
  others: { fr: '31 autres candidats', en: '31 other candidates', es: '31 otras candidaturas' },
};
const HORIZON_ORDER = ['2026-12-31', '2027-06-30', '2028-09-03', '2029-06-30'];
const gateShares = Object.entries(d.gate_shares).sort((a: any, b: any) => b[1] - a[1]) as Array<[string, number]>;
const horizonLabel = (iso: string) =>
  new Date(`${iso}T12:00:00`).toLocaleDateString(
    locale === 'en' ? 'en-GB' : locale === 'es' ? 'es-ES' : 'fr-FR',
    { month: 'long', year: 'numeric' },
  );
const SENS_LABELS: Record<string, Record<Locale, string>> = {
  farage_charged_double: { fr: 'Mise en accusation doublée (30 → 60 %)', en: 'Charge probability doubled (30 → 60%)', es: 'Imputación duplicada (30 → 60 %)' },
  no_resign_on_charge: { fr: 'Il ne démissionne JAMAIS sur mise en accusation', en: 'He never resigns when charged', es: 'Nunca renuncia al ser imputado' },
  no_resign_before_petition: { fr: 'Personne ne démissionne avant la pétition', en: 'Nobody resigns ahead of the petition', es: 'Nadie renuncia antes de la petición' },
  custodial_double: { fr: 'Peine de prison doublée (25 → 40 %)', en: 'Custodial sentence doubled (25 → 40%)', es: 'Pena de prisión duplicada (25 → 40 %)' },
  new_inquiry_certain: { fr: 'Nouvelle enquête du commissaire quasi certaine (65 → 90 %)', en: 'New standards inquiry near-certain (65 → 90%)', es: 'Nueva investigación casi segura (65 → 90 %)' },
  suspension_severe: { fr: 'Suspension lourde beaucoup plus probable (42 → 70 %)', en: 'Heavy suspension much more likely (42 → 70%)', es: 'Suspensión grave mucho más probable (42 → 70 %)' },
  petition_easy: { fr: 'Pétition traitée comme une formalité (65 → 83 %)', en: 'Petition treated as a formality (65 → 83%)', es: 'Petición tratada como trámite (65 → 83 %)' },
  resigns_like_july: { fr: 'Il redémissionne au rythme de juillet', en: 'He resigns again at July’s rate', es: 'Vuelve a renunciar al ritmo de julio' },
};

const jsonLd = [
  {
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'NewsArticle',
    headline: t.headline,
    description: t.description,
    url: canonical,
    inLanguage: locale,
    dateModified: d.run_date,
    author: { '@type': 'Person', name: 'Kim Leclerc', url: 'https://kimleclerc.ca' },
  },
];
---

<EditorialLayout
  title={t.title}
  description={t.description}
  canonical={canonical}
  lang={locale}
  currentPage="uk"
  ogImage="https://vote-scope.com/og/vote-scope.png"
  alternates={alternates}
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
>
  <article class="ukrecall">
    <header class="ukrecall-hero container">
      <p class="ukrecall-kicker">{t.kicker}</p>
      <h1>{t.headline}</h1>
      <p class="ukrecall-dek">{t.dek}</p>
      <GooglePreferredSource locale={locale} />
    </header>

    <section class="container" aria-labelledby="ukrecall-src">
      <div class="ukrecall-source">
        <p class="ukrecall-source-label" id="ukrecall-src">{t.sourceLabel}</p>
        <p class="ukrecall-source-body">{t.sourceBody}</p>
        <p class="ukrecall-source-stance">{t.sourceStance}</p>
        <p class="ukrecall-source-links-label">{t.sourceLinks}</p>
        <ul class="ukrecall-source-links">
          <li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aXut3s90rUI" rel="noreferrer">{t.linkVideo}</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://www.channel4.com/news/exclusive-nigel-farage-filmed-undercover-celebrating-secret-new-foreign-donations" rel="noreferrer">{t.linkArticle}</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://channel4news.substack.com/p/exclusive-nigel-farage-filmed-undercover" rel="noreferrer">{t.linkSubstack}</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://www.channel4.com/news/nigel-farage-should-face-full-force-of-law-if-found-guilty-of-election-rules-breach-sir-ed-davey" rel="noreferrer">{t.linkReaction}</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="container" aria-labelledby="ukrecall-feed">
      <p class="ukrecall-label" id="ukrecall-feed">{t.feedLabel}</p>
      <p class="ukrecall-body">{t.feedIntro}</p>
      <ol class="ukrecall-feed">
        {FEED.map((item) => (
          <li class={`is-${item.kind}`}>
            <p class="ukrecall-feed-head">
              <span class="ukrecall-feed-kind">
                {item.kind === 'report' ? t.feedKindReport : item.kind === 'reaction' ? t.feedKindReaction : t.feedKindResponse}
              </span>
              <a href={item.url} rel="noreferrer">{item.source}</a>
            </p>
            <p class="ukrecall-feed-body">{item[locale]}</p>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="container" aria-labelledby="ukrecall-q1">
      <p class="ukrecall-label" id="ukrecall-q1">{t.q1Label}</p>
      <div class="ukrecall-table-wrap">
        <table class="ukrecall-table">
          <thead><tr><th>{t.thHorizon}</th><th>{t.thVacant}</th><th>{t.thHeld}</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            {HORIZON_ORDER.map((k) => (
              <tr class={k === '2027-06-30' ? 'is-highlight' : ''}>
                <td>{horizonLabel(k)}</td>
                <td>{pct(horizons[k].p_seat_vacant)}%</td>
                <td><strong>{pct(horizons[k].p_byelection_held)}%</strong></td>
              </tr>
            ))}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <p class="ukrecall-label">{t.gatesLabel}</p>
      <p class="ukrecall-body">{t.gatesIntro}</p>
      <ul class="ukrecall-gates">
        {gateShares.map(([gate, share]) => (
          <li>
            <div class="ukrecall-gate-bar"><div style={`width:${share * 100}%`}></div></div>
            <span class="ukrecall-gate-name">{GATE_LABELS[gate][locale]}</span>
            <strong class="ukrecall-gate-pct">{pct(share, 0)}%</strong>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="container" aria-labelledby="ukrecall-counter">
      <p class="ukrecall-label" id="ukrecall-counter">{t.counterLabel}</p>
      <p class="ukrecall-body ukrecall-body-lead">{t.counterBody}</p>
    </section>

    <section class="container" aria-labelledby="ukrecall-sens">
      <p class="ukrecall-label" id="ukrecall-sens">{t.sensLabel}</p>
      <p class="ukrecall-body">{t.sensIntro}</p>
      <div class="ukrecall-table-wrap">
        <table class="ukrecall-table">
          <thead><tr><th>{t.thVariant}</th><th>{t.thBy2027}</th><th>{t.thBy2029}</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            {(d.sensitivity as any[]).map((s) => (
              <tr>
                <td>{SENS_LABELS[s.id]?.[locale] ?? s.id}</td>
                <td>{pct(s.p_byelection_2027_06)}%</td>
                <td>{pct(s.p_byelection_2029_06)}%</td>
              </tr>
            ))}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="container" aria-labelledby="ukrecall-pet">
      <p class="ukrecall-label" id="ukrecall-pet">{t.petitionLabel}</p>
      <p class="ukrecall-body">{t.petitionBody}</p>
    </section>

    <section class="container" aria-labelledby="ukrecall-q2">
      <p class="ukrecall-label" id="ukrecall-q2">{t.q2Label}</p>
      <p class="ukrecall-body">{t.q2Intro}</p>
      <ClactonScenarioPicker
        grid={race.grid}
        locale={locale}
        buckets={BUCKETS}
        colors={COLORS}
        client:visible
      />
    </section>

    <section class="container" aria-labelledby="ukrecall-val">
      <p class="ukrecall-label" id="ukrecall-val">{t.validationLabel}</p>
      <p class="ukrecall-body">{t.validationIntro}</p>
      <div class="ukrecall-table-wrap">
        <table class="ukrecall-table">
          <thead><tr><th>{t.thBucket}</th><th>{t.thModel}</th><th>{t.thActual}</th><th>{t.thError}</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            {(published?.rows ?? []).map((r: any) => (
              <tr>
                <td>{PUBLISHED_LABELS[r.bucket]?.[locale] ?? r.bucket}</td>
                <td>{nf(r.published_q50)}% <small>[{nf(r.published_q10, 0)}–{nf(r.published_q90, 0)}]</small></td>
                <td>{nf(r.actual_pct, 2)}%</td>
                <td class={Math.abs(r.error_pts) < 2 ? 'is-good' : ''}>{r.error_pts >= 0 ? '+' : '−'}{nf(Math.abs(r.error_pts), 2)}</td>
              </tr>
            ))}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="ukrecall-body" style="margin-top:14px;">
        <a class="cta-link" href={`/${locale}/track-record/`}>{t.trackRecordCta}</a>
      </p>

      <p class="ukrecall-label">{t.inSampleLabel}</p>
      <p class="ukrecall-body">{t.inSampleBody}</p>
    </section>

    <section class="container" aria-labelledby="ukrecall-mkt">
      <p class="ukrecall-label" id="ukrecall-mkt">{t.marketsLabel}</p>
      <p class="ukrecall-body">{t.marketsBody}</p>
    </section>

    <MethodologyNote
      title={t.methodTitle}
      body={t.methodBody}
      bullets={[
        `Run ${d.run_date} · ${d.n_sims.toLocaleString(locale === 'en' ? 'en-GB' : locale === 'es' ? 'es-ES' : 'fr-FR')} simulations · ${Object.keys(race.grid).length} scénarios de course`,
        `Recall of MPs Act 2015 · ${d.signatures_needed.toLocaleString(locale === 'en' ? 'en-GB' : locale === 'es' ? 'es-ES' : 'fr-FR')} signatures = 10 %`,
      ]}
    />
  </article>
</EditorialLayout>

<style>
  .ukrecall-hero { padding-top: 40px; }
  .ukrecall-kicker { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-3); }
  .ukrecall-hero h1 { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.2vw, 3.1rem); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.015em; margin: 0.35rem 0 1rem; max-width: 24ch; }
  .ukrecall-dek { font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 78ch; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .ukrecall-label { margin-top: 42px; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-3); }
  .ukrecall-body { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; max-width: 82ch; }
  .ukrecall-body-lead { font-size: 16px; }
  .ukrecall-note { margin-top: 10px; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--ink-3); max-width: 82ch; }

  .ukrecall-source { margin-top: 26px; padding: 22px 24px; border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-left: 4px solid #12B6CF; border-radius: 4px; background: var(--card); }
  .ukrecall-source-label { margin: 0 0 9px; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-3); }
  .ukrecall-source-body { margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; max-width: 82ch; }
  .ukrecall-source-stance { margin: 16px 0 0; padding-left: 14px; border-left: 2px solid var(--ink-3); font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.5; max-width: 62ch; }
  .ukrecall-source-links-label { margin: 20px 0 6px; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-3); }
  .ukrecall-source-links { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.1rem; }
  .ukrecall-source-links li { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 5px; }

  .ukrecall-feed { list-style: none; margin: 16px 0 0; padding: 0; }
  .ukrecall-feed li {
    padding: 14px 0 14px 16px;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--rule);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .ukrecall-feed li.is-response { border-left-color: #12B6CF; }
  .ukrecall-feed li.is-reaction { border-left-color: var(--ink-3); }
  .ukrecall-feed-head { margin: 0 0 5px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; align-items: baseline; }
  .ukrecall-feed-kind {
    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-3);
  }
  .ukrecall-feed-head a { font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; }
  .ukrecall-feed-body { margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--ink-2); max-width: 82ch; }
  .ukrecall-table-wrap { margin-top: 14px; overflow-x: auto; }
  .ukrecall-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px; }
  .ukrecall-table th, .ukrecall-table td { text-align: left; padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule-2); }
  .ukrecall-table th { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-3); white-space: nowrap; }
  .ukrecall-table tr.is-highlight td { background: rgba(18, 182, 207, 0.09); }
  .ukrecall-table td.is-good { color: #2f7d32; font-family: var(--mono); }

  .ukrecall-gates { list-style: none; margin: 14px 0 0; padding: 0; }
  .ukrecall-gates li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 160px 1fr auto; gap: 14px; align-items: center; padding: 9px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule-2); font-size: 14px; }
  .ukrecall-gates li:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
  .ukrecall-gate-bar { height: 12px; border-radius: 2px; background: var(--background-contrast-1, rgba(0,0,0,.05)); overflow: hidden; }
  .ukrecall-gate-bar div { height: 100%; background: #12B6CF; }
  .ukrecall-gate-pct { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 17px; font-weight: 430; }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .ukrecall-gates li { grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; }
    .ukrecall-gate-bar { grid-column: 1 / -1; order: 2; }
  }
</style>
